s feeling stable and has no new symptoms.\n\n**April 24, 2023**\nBrianna's visit on April 24, 2023, was for her Heart failure / cardiomyopathy. Her blood pressure was 129/81 mmHg, and her weight was 179 pounds. She continues to be stable and adheres to her medication regimen. Brianna reports feeling well and has no new symptoms.\n\n**November 05, 2022**\nBrianna was seen today regarding a back strain. Her blood pressure was 144/89 mmHg, and her weight was 188 pounds. Brianna has recovered from the back strain, and her heart condition remains well-managed.\n\n**May 19, 2022**\nBrianna was seen on this date for a lab review. H"
